<% page_title "Terms of Service" %>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1 class="h-page">Terms of Service</h1>
  <div class="card mt-8 p-6 md:p-8 prose-ink">
    <p>All In is provided by <%= settings[:church_name] %> to help people who are new to our church get connected. By creating an account you agree to use it for that purpose.</p>
    <p>Your account is personal to you. Please keep your password private and let us know if you think it has been used by someone else.</p>
    <p>We may update the content of All In at any time. We may suspend or remove accounts that are used abusively.</p>
    <p>Questions: <%= mail_to settings[:church_email] %>.</p>
    <p class="text-mute text-sm">Replace this placeholder with terms reviewed by your church's leadership before launch.</p>
  </div>
</div>
